{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>You're the new keeper of a forgotten chapel! </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666000/extras/1ac317bfad0cacb1bd60d6bfc328356a.webp?t=1768396168\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666000/extras/1ac317bfad0cacb1bd60d6bfc328356a.poster.webp?t=1768396168\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=250 /></picture></span><br><i>But by sunrise, you might vanish like the others....</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Use whatever you can to survive.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You only have your cleaning supplies, and you're not alone. Fight off grotesque creatures by lighting fires, hurling trash, or smashing them with your broom \u2014 but every action costs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666000/extras/8501407bcf5ac8764dd1e179b2683c66.webp?t=1768396168\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666000/extras/8501407bcf5ac8764dd1e179b2683c66.poster.webp?t=1768396168\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=250 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Complete your chores\u2026 or disappear.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clean the chapel floors. Empty the trash bins. Maintain the graveyard and keep the lights on. If the sun rises and your duties are unfinished, you\u2019ll meet a horrible fate....</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666000/extras/e98f9ec74a67cb6936f5acd793c444aa.webp?t=1768396168\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666000/extras/e98f9ec74a67cb6936f5acd793c444aa.poster.webp?t=1768396168\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=250 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Keep an eye on the ticking clock.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your smartwatch is your lifeline. Track your health, stamina, remaining chores, fuel levels \u2014 and the relentless approach of sunrise. Every second counts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666000/extras/b63d9104e5ad6a7a0aa02b13c8d6d04f.webp?t=1768396168\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666000/extras/b63d9104e5ad6a7a0aa02b13c8d6d04f.poster.webp?t=1768396168\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=250 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A story buried in dust and shadow.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the mystery of the chapel\u2019s past, and learn why this sacred place has become a battleground between the mundane and the monstrous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666000/extras/467dfb92b0a58f1896ea7f96477f5998.webp?t=1768396168\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666000/extras/467dfb92b0a58f1896ea7f96477f5998.poster.webp?t=1768396168\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=250 /></picture></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3666000?t=1768396168","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3666000?t=1768396168","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666000/87dfccd0564a06284d83a646987ff2407ea22a87/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768396168","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666000/87dfccd0564a06284d83a646987ff2407ea22a87/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768396168","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Restless Rites contains scenes of gore and blood, alongside some dark and frightening sequences."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>You're the new keeper of a forgotten chapel! </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666000/extras/1ac317bfad0cacb1bd60d6bfc328356a.webp?t=1768396168\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666000/extras/1ac317bfad0cacb1bd60d6bfc328356a.poster.webp?t=1768396168\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=250 /></picture></span><br><i>But by sunrise, you might vanish like the others....</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Use whatever you can to survive.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You only have your cleaning supplies, and you're not alone. Fight off grotesque creatures by lighting fires, hurling trash, or smashing them with your broom \u2014 but every action costs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666000/extras/8501407bcf5ac8764dd1e179b2683c66.webp?t=1768396168\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666000/extras/8501407bcf5ac8764dd1e179b2683c66.poster.webp?t=1768396168\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=250 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Complete your chores\u2026 or disappear.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clean the chapel floors. Empty the trash bins. Maintain the graveyard and keep the lights on. If the sun rises and your duties are unfinished, you\u2019ll meet a horrible fate....</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666000/extras/e98f9ec74a67cb6936f5acd793c444aa.webp?t=1768396168\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666000/extras/e98f9ec74a67cb6936f5acd793c444aa.poster.webp?t=1768396168\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=250 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Keep an eye on the ticking clock.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your smartwatch is your lifeline. Track your health, stamina, remaining chores, fuel levels \u2014 and the relentless approach of sunrise. Every second counts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666000/extras/b63d9104e5ad6a7a0aa02b13c8d6d04f.webp?t=1768396168\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666000/extras/b63d9104e5ad6a7a0aa02b13c8d6d04f.poster.webp?t=1768396168\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=250 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A story buried in dust and shadow.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the mystery of the chapel\u2019s past, and learn why this sacred place has become a battleground between the mundane and the monstrous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666000/extras/467dfb92b0a58f1896ea7f96477f5998.webp?t=1768396168\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666000/extras/467dfb92b0a58f1896ea7f96477f5998.poster.webp?t=1768396168\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=250 /></picture></span></p>","developers":["Pale Oposs